# Leibniz Agent - Error Dialogues
# Environment file for error messages and timeout handling

# Errors Category
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_ERRORS_GENERAL=I'm sorry, I encountered an issue. Could you try again?
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_ERRORS_TIMEOUT=I didn't catch that. Could you please repeat?
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_ERRORS_NO_INPUT=I didn't hear anything. Are you still there? Please say something or I'll end this session.
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_ERRORS_NO_INPUT_MAX=I've been waiting for your response. I'll end this session now. Feel free to start a new conversation anytime.
LEIBNIZ_DIALOGUE_ERRORS_TECHNICAL=I'm experiencing technical difficulties. Please try again in a moment.